  <div class="card" style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px;line-height:1.7;font-size:14px">
    <h1 style="font-size:24px;margin-bottom:6px">Data Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="sub" style="margin-bottom:18px">MediAdmit · Patient Registration, Assessment, and Admission Management System</div>
    <p>MediAdmit stores personal and sensitive personal information of patients, such as names, contact details, assessments, medical history and insurance details. This information is protected under the <b>Data Privacy Act of 2012 (Republic Act No. 10173)</b>.</p>
    <h3 style="font-size:16px;margin:18px 0 6px">As a user of this system, you agree to:</h3>
    <ul style="padding-left:20px">
      <li>Access patient records only when needed for your work at the hospital.</li>
      <li>Keep your password private and never share your account.</li>
      <li>Never copy, print, export or share patient information without authorization.</li>
      <li>Sign out when you leave your computer.</li>
      <li>Report any lost data, wrong access or security problem to the administrator right away.</li>
    </ul>
    <p style="margin-top:14px">Every sign-in and every change to a record is saved in the <b>Audit Trail</b>, including who did it, when, and from which computer.</p>
